DTSTART:20270122T113000Z
DTEND:20270122T120000Z
SUMMARY:Deadline 12:00 GMT: The Whickers Film & TV Funding Award 2027 (GBP 
 120\,000 for a first feature documentary)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 22 Jan 2027 at 12:00 GMT.\n\nThe Whickers Film & TV Fund
 ing Award backs a director-led documentary by a first-time feature directo
 r. The winner receives GBP 120\,000 and the runner-up a GBP 25\,000 develo
 pment award.\n\nOrganisation: The Whickers\nLocation: Open worldwide. Shor
 tlisted directors pitch in person at Sheffield DocFest\, UK\, June 2027 (t
 ravel and accommodation covered).\nAward: GBP 120\,000 main award\; GBP 25
 \,000 development award for the runner-up. Free to enter.\n\nMore: https:/
 /www.whickerawards.com/apply/film-and-tv/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.whickerawards.com/apply/film-and-tv/?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Open worldwide. Shortlisted directors pitch in person at Sheffield
  DocFest\, UK\, June 2027 (travel and accommodation covered).
END:VEVENT
